  "bodyHash": "f5cf0d072187141a",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">這個模組為 Macaw's Bridges 與 Biomes O' Plenty 之間增添了相容性。你是否一直夢想用櫻桃木打造橋樑、屋頂或階梯？現在，有了這個模組，這終於不再是夢想！</span></p>\n<p><em>「我已經安裝了 Macaw's Bridges/Fences/Roofs/Furnitures - BOP，我擔心安裝這個模組會把我已經放置好的橋樑全部刪除。」</em></p>\n<p>別擔心，</p>\n<p>在 Forge 版本中，模組會自動將舊版相容性中的所有舊方塊與物品轉換過來。</p>\n<p>Fabric 版本則需搭配另一個模組使用，你需要配合預先填好的設定檔來自動替換方塊。這些檔案會在啟動遊戲時自動生成（與一般設定檔類似）——更多資訊請見<a href=\"https://github.com/Samlegamer/Macaw-s-Addons/issues/2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></p>\n<p>NeoForge 1.20.6 版本的轉換功能目前無法運作，這是 NeoForge 本身的問題。</p>\n<p><strong>本模組支援：</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>- Macaw's Bridges</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/10/2025-02-06_21-46-35-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Roofs</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/12/2025-02-08_00-03-38-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Fences</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/17/2025-02-08_00-06-53-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Furnitures</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/11/2025-02-06_21-48-31-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Stairs</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/19/2025-02-08_00-21-41-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Doors</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/18/2025-02-08_00-13-34-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Trapdoors</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/20/368347203-e94d95f4-d581-47ac-99e9-f72083d106e3-png.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/13/2025-02-08_00-03-47-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Paths</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/33/2025-02-08_01-23-05-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>- Macaw's Windows</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/14/2025-02-08_00-03-53-png.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/16/2025-02-08_00-04-04-png.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1091/15/2025-02-08_00-03-59-png.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>必要依賴項：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a></strong></p>\n<p>Terrablender 1.18.2+ 以上版本（<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender\" rel=\"nofollow\">FORGE</a>&nbsp;或&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">FABRIC</a>&nbsp;或 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrablender-neoforge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NEOFORGE</a>）</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/glitchcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GlitchCore</a> 1.20.1+ 以上版本（FORGE 或 FABRIC 或 NEOFORGE）</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>選用依賴項：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Mods</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fconfigurable-everything\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configurable Everything</a></p>",
